\citation{arpa2024ferrara}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Run-level aggregate$-$decimate lead-time difference (h) per detector; the unit of inference is in each panel title. XJTU-SY, FEMTO, Ferrara: mean (dot) and 95\% bootstrap CI over runs (Table~\ref  {tab:crossds}). IMS, on a wider scale: the three per-run differences and their median (diamond). ONGC: the descriptive $n=1$ median (hollow), a case study outside the four inferential datasets (Appendix~D.2). IMS and ONGC values are in Table~\ref  {tab:imsongc}. Shaded: the $\pm 1$~h equivalence margin.\relax }}{11}{}\protected@file@percent }
